{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05392","headline":"和宋之问寒食题临江驿 · 胡皓","name":"和宋之问寒食题临江驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道山阴会，仍爲火忌辰。\n途中甘弃日，江上苦伤春。\n流水飜催泪，寒灰更伴人。\n丹心终不改，白发爲谁新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}